# Scripts & Environment

| Script | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | tsx watch, auto-restart, auto-deploy commands |
| `npm run build` | Prisma generate + TypeScript compile |
| `npm start` | Production from `dist/` |
| `npm run deploy-commands` | Manual guild command deploy |
| `npm run db:migrate` | Create/apply Prisma migration |
| `npm run db:push` | Push schema without migration |
| `npm run db:studio` | Prisma Studio |
| `npm run db:generate` | Regenerate Prisma client |
| `npm run db:up` | Start local Postgres (Docker Compose, port 5433) |
| `npm run db:down` | Stop local Postgres (volume kept) |
| `npm run db:clone` | Dump hosted public data → local Postgres |
| `npm run db:clone:heroes` | Same clone, `"Hero"` table only |

## Env vars

- `DISCORD_TOKEN`, `CLIENT_ID`, `GUILD_ID`
- `DATABASE_URL` — Supabase pooled (6543), or local `127.0.0.1:5433` when using Docker Compose
- `DIRECT_URL` — Supabase session/direct (5432), or the same local URL as `DATABASE_URL`
- `PROD_DIRECT_URL` — hosted session/direct URL (5432) for `npm run db:clone` after `.env` points at local Postgres. Never the 6543 pooler.
- `NODE_ENV` — `development` | `production`
- `AUTO_DEPLOY_COMMANDS` — auto-register commands on startup
- `GEMINI_API_KEY` — Google Gemini API key for lobby screenshot OCR
- `LOG_LEVEL` — `fatal` | `error` | `warn` | `info` | `verbose` | `debug` | `trace` (default: `debug` in dev, `info` in production)
- `MATCH_MOD_ROLE_ID` — fallback Discord role that may report/cancel in-progress matches (host always can); overridden per guild after `/config set mod_role`
- `MATCH_CREATE_ROLE_ID` — fallback Discord role required to run `/register_lobby` (empty/unset = creation disabled); overridden per guild after `/config set create_role`
- `WC3STATS_ENABLED` — `true` to import live Ultimate Dragon Ball Reborn lobbies from wc3stats (default `false`)
- `WC3STATS_MAP_PATTERN` — regex vs map filename / path / normalizedName (default `ultimate.?dragon.?ball.?reborn|udbr`)
- `WC3STATS_MAP_SHA1` — comma-separated `map.sha1` allowlist from `GET /gamelist/{id}` (not the list `hash`). UDBR 2.4f: `19783c6259e86253a8c940ede63a87e18204bd94`
- `WC3STATS_TIMEOUT_MS` — wc3stats HTTP timeout (default `4000`)

Production: every bot env key must also live in AWS SSM and `deploy/aws/refresh-env.sh` — see `.cursor/rules/env-aws-sync.mdc`.
